{"ts":"2026-07-06T21:09:17.588Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/472\n\nWhen `pm create` rejects an item because the type has required custom fields, include the required field names (and expected types) in the structured error instead of a generic message, saving agents a `pm schema` round-trip.\n\nRelated: pm-qmjx (GH-441 type-aware create help mislabels required flags) — same required-fields metadata source should power both help and error paths."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-4bzq"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-472: create error for missing required custom fields lists the field names"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Dogfood GH-472: creating an item whose type has required custom fields fails without naming the missing fields, costing agents a pm schema round-trip. Duplicate check: searched create required fields error — pm-qmjx (GH-441) covers the create --help required-list mislabeling; this is the runtime error path, related but distinct."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-experience","area:cli","errors","gh-issue","schema"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T21:09:17.588Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T21:09:17.588Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"pm create failure for missing required type-specific fields names each missing field (and expected type/format) in the error and recovery examples; consistent across strict and progressive create-mode; covered by specs"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","va